{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"このあと18時からはMUSIC FAIR♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"藤あや子さんと乃木坂46で「恋におちて」をコラボ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして私はピアノを弾かせていただきました(o^^o)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"素敵な歌声とメロディー、ストリングスのみなさんの音色に合わせて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"心地よく演奏できました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぜひ見てくださいっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/04/05/8428933/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は全握でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブでは全ての8thの曲をフルで披露しました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ダンケシェーン！みなさん合いの手やってくださってました！(;_;)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今までにない感じですごく楽しかったです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました<(_ _*)>"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また一緒にはっちゃけましょうっ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会も、かわいいみなみとペアで楽しかったですっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日も京都でお待ちしてるどすー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/erika.ikuta/img/erika.ikuta/img/2014/04/05/8428933/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしてお知らせ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週の金曜日、乃木坂46"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"初のMステ出演決まりました！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなの1つの目標だったので、とっても嬉しいです☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方に見ていただけると思うので、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂いいなぁって思ってもらえるように頑張ります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも見てるからほんとに緊張だけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみたいな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん来週ぜひ見てください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリカ(。・∀・。)☆彡"}],"source":"archive"}